id=a52s_camera_no_abort
name=A52s Camera No-Abort (CSL)
version=1.0
versionCode=1
author=QuantumROM
description=NOPa o raise(6) no CSLAcquireDeviceHW do camera.qcom.so (BuildId 9b26d985) para o provider de camera NAO abortar quando o acquire do sensor principal falha (evita SIGABRT e tela preta na GCam (1x) sem o libMOTION.so